# Software industry mapping for ERP
@prefix sw: <https://ecosystemcode.com/ontology/erp/software#> .
@prefix legacy: <https://example.com/legacy/software#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

legacy:subscription_sales_order owl:equivalentClass sw:SubscriptionSalesOrder .
legacy:subscription_sales_order_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:subscriptionSalesOrderId .
legacy:software_vendor owl:equivalentClass sw:SoftwareVendor .
legacy:software_vendor_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:softwareVendorId .
legacy:contracted_through_software_vendor rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:contractedThroughSoftwareVendor .
